    {
      "id": "0c7de4e2-118e-4ec7-8ee7-5b890e5497c8",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-06T11:47:06.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS misses analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: ₹74.42 loss per share (down from ₹7.93 profit in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹149.0b (flat on FY 2025). Net loss: ₹19.0b (down ₹21.0b from profit in FY 2025). Revenue was in line with analyst estimates. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates. Revenue is forecast to grow 6.0% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Chemicals industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 104 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
